flowchart LR
    subgraph APP[One Camel Spring Boot application]
        V[Unmarshal and validate] --> A[direct:adjudicate]
        A <-->|InOut evidence reads| Q[JDBC lookup routes]
        T[Claim and coverage tools] <--> Q
        A --> CHECK[Recheck evidence and decision]
        CHECK --> R[Serialize automatic decision]
        V -->|Invalid event| F[Failure route]
        A -->|Retries exhausted| F
        CHECK -->|Invalid recommendation| F
        P[Project review and human-decision events]
        L[list_manual_reviews]
        S[get_human_decision]
        H[submit_human_decision]
        W[Validate command, reserve review, record audit]
    end
    IN[Kafka: incoming-claims] --> V
    A <-->|HTTP| AI[AI server]
    MCP[Bob or another MCP client] <-->|Streamable HTTP on Undertow| T
    MCP <-->|List open reviews| L
    MCP <-->|Read decision status| S
    MCP -->|Human-confirmed decision| H
    Q <-->|Parameterized JDBC| DB[(Claims, coverage, and review audit)]
    CHECK <-->|JDBC verification| DB
    L <--> DB
    S <--> DB
    W <--> DB
    R --> OUT[Kafka: adjudicated-claims]
    OUT --> P
    P --> DB
    H --> CMD[Kafka: human-claim-decisions]
    CMD --> W
    W -->|Final human decision| OUT
    W -->|Rejected command| ERR[Kafka: failed-claims]
    F --> ERR
